oducible in 4.4 beta1\nNot reproducible in 4.4 dev7\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c1ca89c-d1b2-44c2-98dd-e47922e6f944\n\nThese are 2 particle systems with the same settings, left one is CPU particles, right one is GPU. The CPU ones are not random.\n\nI suspect it's caused by #92089, specifically the change from `Math::randf()` to `rand_from_seed()`. I think the class should still use `randf()`, just from a seeded RNG instance.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun MRP scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[particlebug.tscn.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18483037/particlebug.tscn.txt)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101859/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101859/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}